experiment: ippool
  instrument        ippool   trial seed 0000000001353e69   4857 trials
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  question          stageprobe put the compression in intrinsic plasticity
                    (bias->rate 0.34 on, 0.91 off). v57 exempted 13 of a
                    group's 14 directions and halved the learned bias; v58
                    exempted a magnitude. DNA v74 exempts ONE DIRECTION --
                    the group's zero-mean ramp, the readout's own coordinate.
  the gate          EXCESS over each arm's OWN matched-marginal control,
                    r1 vs r0, PAIRED on seed, at 2 SE -- AND the larynx rate
                    still regulated, or it is v50's refuted trade.
  the bar is v58    not zero. dF1 ~ aligned^0.61 already closes v58's
                    aligned x1.21 by arithmetic (+12.3% against the x1.68
                    the ceiling needs), so `aligned` must beat x1.21 or this
                    is the same closure again. The POWER block prints it.
  and a 3rd refusal the threshold drift. v57 pushed it back 3x harder
                    (+0.344 vs the shipped +0.105) because every neuron got
                    a slice MEAN; a projection subtracts a component instead,
                    so drift near shipped is the check that this is not
                    pooling in disguise.
  stated up front   n = 18, and a 2-3 SE result at that size is a HYPOTHESIS
                    in this project; three have been retracted. And a null
                    here does not rule out a convergence-SPEED effect.
  the stopping rule if the ratio clears v58's x1.21 at 2 SE, this run
                    settles it. If the POINT estimate exceeds 1.21 but the
                    SE does not resolve it, the follow-up is a PRE-COMMITTED
                    n = 72 on fresh seed families (seed + 36*7919 and
                    beyond) -- NOT seeds added to this sample until it
                    clears. If the point estimate is under 1.21, the
                    coordinate-system route is closed and the readout is
                    what is left.


